## Interface: 30300
## Title: InstanceGPS
## Notes: Guides you through every Classic, TBC and WotLK dungeon and raid: the shortest route to every boss, with a navigation arrow, the path on your map, minimap and HUD, and hints for event triggers. Also tracks boss kills, run times and kill statistics. /igps
